<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$5 bln NCDs on Saturday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$5 bln NCDs on Saturday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank said on Friday it would issue T$5 billion in one-month negotiable certificates of deposits on Saturday.</p>
<p>Bids would close at 10.20 am (0220 GMT), a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The central bank has said that its recent NCD issues were mainly in response to the liquidity situation.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
